<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  AI Even Switcher
  ================

  An Even/Odd bot with two strategies and a rule for switching between them.

  Primary strategy (mode 0 — "AI Even"): every cycle the bot scans EVERY
  volatility market Signal Lab is streaming, scores each one for Even/Odd,
  moves to the strongest market and buys Even there. The scan floor ships at
  0, so the bot always finds a market to stand on; it never sits idle for
  want of a signal.

  Recovery strategy (mode 1 — "Markov + AI"): the first loss switches the
  bot into recovery. Entries now have to pass a Markov transition gate as
  well as the scan: the bot measures, from the last 1000 ticks of the market
  it is standing on, the chance that the current last digit becomes an EVEN
  digit by expiry (the five "digit transition" blocks summed into
  "ai markov"). It buys Even while that measured chance clears
  "ai markov threshold", and Odd while the same measurement says Odd is the
  likelier side by the same margin — so recovery trades whichever parity
  the transition table actually favours, on whichever market the scan picks.

  Switching back: recovery ends the moment a win returns the session profit
  to zero or better. The mode reverts to AI Even, the stake resets to
  "ai base stake" and the loss counter clears. A win that still leaves the
  session below zero keeps the bot in recovery at the current stake — it
  does not declare victory early.

  Staking: after a loss the stake multiplies by "ai multiplier", up to
  "ai max steps" multiplications in a row; past the cap the ladder restarts
  at the base stake instead of growing without bound. Every stake also
  passes the balance cap ("ai stake percent"), and the loss/profit guards
  stop new entries at "ai loss limit" / "ai profit target". The journal
  announces every switch, so you can watch the mode change as it happens.

  Why the recovery is Markov and not Rise/Fall: one DBot workspace has a
  single Trade options trade type, and this workspace trades Even/Odd — a
  Rise/Fall contract cannot be bought from inside it. Markov + the AI
  market scan is the recovery that fits the workspace; run a Rise/Fall bot
  alongside if you want that exposure too.

  Read this before running it for real
  Even/Odd pays a little under double and the digit stream is close to
  fair, so neither strategy here manufactures an edge: the scan finds the
  market leaning most right now, and the Markov gate only lets recovery
  entries through when transitions measurably favour a side. Martingale
  recovery can still reach its cap. Start on a demo account, keep
  "ai base stake" small, and set "ai loss limit" to what a session may cost.

  Tuning, all of it in the "Run once at start" block:

    ai base stake        0.35  the first stake, and the one recovery resets to
    ai duration          1     ticks per contract (also the Markov horizon)
    ai markov threshold  53    measured chance (%) a recovery entry must clear
    ai multiplier        2     martingale multiplier after a loss
    ai max steps         5     stake multiplications before the ladder restarts
    ai loss limit        30    stop entering after this much session loss
    ai profit target     50    stop entering after this much session profit
    ai stake percent     2     never stake more than this % of the balance
-->
<xml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" collection="false" is_dbot="true">
  <variables>
    <variable type="" id="evVar01">ai base stake</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar02">ai stake</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar03">ai duration</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar04">ai mode</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar05">ai markov</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar06">ai markov threshold</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar07">ai multiplier</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar08">ai loss count</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar09">ai max steps</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar10">ai loss limit</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar11">ai profit target</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar12">ai stake percent</variable>
    <variable type="" id="evVar13">ai contracts</variable>
  </variables>
  <block type="trade_definition" id="evTrade01" x="0" y="0">
    <statement name="TRADE_OPTIONS">
      <block type="trade_definition_market" id="evMarket01" deletable="false" movable="false">
        <field name="MARKET_LIST">volidx</field>
        <field name="SUBMARKET_LIST">random_index</field>
        <field name="SYMBOL_LIST">R_100</field>
        <next>
          <block type="trade_definition_tradetype" id="evType01" deletable="false" movable="false">
            <field name="TRADETYPECAT_LIST">digits</field>
            <field name="TRADETYPE_LIST">evenodd</field>
            <next>
              <block type="trade_definition_contracttype" id="evContract01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                <field name="TYPE_LIST">both</field>
                <next>
                  <block type="trade_definition_candleinterval" id="evCandle01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                    <field name="CANDLEINTERVAL_LIST">60</field>
                    <next>
                      <block type="trade_definition_restartbuysell" id="evRestart01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                        <field name="TIME_MACHINE_ENABLED">FALSE</field>
                        <next>
                          <block type="trade_definition_restartonerror" id="evError01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                            <field name="RESTARTONERROR">TRUE</field>
                          </block>
                        </next>
                      </block>
                    </next>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
    <statement name="INITIALIZATION">
      <block type="variables_set" id="evIs01"><field name="VAR" id="evVar01">ai base stake</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn01"><field name="NUM">0.35</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs02"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn02"><field name="NUM">0.35</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs03"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn03"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs04"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn04"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs05"><field name="VAR" id="evVar05">ai markov</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn05"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs06"><field name="VAR" id="evVar06">ai markov threshold</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn06"><field name="NUM">53</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs07"><field name="VAR" id="evVar07">ai multiplier</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn07"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs08"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn08"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs09"><field name="VAR" id="evVar09">ai max steps</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn09"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs10"><field name="VAR" id="evVar10">ai loss limit</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn10"><field name="NUM">30</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs11"><field name="VAR" id="evVar11">ai profit target</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn11"><field name="NUM">50</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs12"><field name="VAR" id="evVar12">ai stake percent</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn12"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="evIs13"><field name="VAR" id="evVar13">ai contracts</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evIn13"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="notify" id="evNotifyBoot"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">success</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="evBootText"><field name="TEXT">AI Even Switcher armed — scanning every market for Even; a loss switches to Markov + AI recovery, recovery reverts in profit.</field></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block>
    </statement>
    <statement name="SUBMARKET">
      <block type="trade_definition_tradeoptions" id="evOptions01">
        <mutation has_first_barrier="false" has_second_barrier="false" has_prediction="false"></mutation>
        <field name="DURATIONTYPE_LIST">t</field>
        <field name="CURRENCY_LIST">USD</field>
        <value name="DURATION"><block type="variables_get" id="evDurGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value>
        <value name="AMOUNT">
          <block type="r_safe_stake" id="evSafe01">
            <value name="STAKE"><block type="variables_get" id="evStakeGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field></block></value>
            <value name="PERCENT"><block type="variables_get" id="evPctGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar12">ai stake percent</field></block></value>
          </block>
        </value>
        <field name="AMOUNT_LIMITS"></field>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="before_purchase" id="evBefore01" x="0" y="760">
    <statement name="BEFOREPURCHASE_STACK">
      <block type="signal_lab_scan_markets" id="evScan01">
        <field name="FAMILY">even-odd</field>
        <value name="DURATION"><shadow type="math_number" id="evScanDur"><field name="NUM">20</field></shadow></value>
        <value name="MIN_SCORE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evScanFloor"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value>
        <next>
          <block type="controls_if" id="evSwitchIf">
            <value name="IF0"><block type="signal_lab_scan_tradeable" id="evSwitchCheck"></block></value>
            <statement name="DO0"><block type="signal_lab_switch_to_best" id="evSwitchBest"></block></statement>
            <next>
              <block type="variables_set" id="evMarkovSet">
                <field name="VAR" id="evVar05">ai markov</field>
                <value name="VALUE">
                  <block type="math_arithmetic" id="evSum0"><field name="OP">ADD</field>
                    <value name="A"><block type="m_transition" id="evT0"><value name="FROM"><block type="last_digit" id="evT0From"></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="evT0To"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="evT0Hor"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value><value name="LIST"><block type="ticks" id="evT0Ticks"></block></value></block></value>
                    <value name="B">
                      <block type="math_arithmetic" id="evSum2"><field name="OP">ADD</field>
                        <value name="A"><block type="m_transition" id="evT2"><value name="FROM"><block type="last_digit" id="evT2From"></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="evT2To"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="evT2Hor"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value><value name="LIST"><block type="ticks" id="evT2Ticks"></block></value></block></value>
                        <value name="B">
                          <block type="math_arithmetic" id="evSum4"><field name="OP">ADD</field>
                            <value name="A"><block type="m_transition" id="evT4"><value name="FROM"><block type="last_digit" id="evT4From"></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="evT4To"><field name="NUM">4</field></shadow></value><value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="evT4Hor"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value><value name="LIST"><block type="ticks" id="evT4Ticks"></block></value></block></value>
                            <value name="B">
                              <block type="math_arithmetic" id="evSum6"><field name="OP">ADD</field>
                                <value name="A"><block type="m_transition" id="evT6"><value name="FROM"><block type="last_digit" id="evT6From"></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="evT6To"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value><value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="evT6Hor"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value><value name="LIST"><block type="ticks" id="evT6Ticks"></block></value></block></value>
                                <value name="B"><block type="m_transition" id="evT8"><value name="FROM"><block type="last_digit" id="evT8From"></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="evT8To"><field name="NUM">8</field></shadow></value><value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="evT8Hor"><field name="VAR" id="evVar03">ai duration</field></block></value><value name="LIST"><block type="ticks" id="evT8Ticks"></block></value></block></value>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                  </block>
                </value>
                <next>
                  <block type="controls_if" id="evEntryIf">
                    <value name="IF0">
                      <block type="logic_operation" id="evGateAnd1"><field name="OP">AND</field>
                        <value name="A"><block type="logic_operation" id="evGateAnd2"><field name="OP">AND</field>
                          <value name="A"><block type="signal_lab_scan_tradeable" id="evGateScan"></block></value>
                          <value name="B"><block type="r_loss_guard" id="evGateLoss"><value name="LIMIT"><block type="variables_get" id="evGateLossGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar10">ai loss limit</field></block></value></block></value>
                        </block></value>
                        <value name="B"><block type="r_profit_guard" id="evGateProfit"><value name="TARGET"><block type="variables_get" id="evGateProfitGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar11">ai profit target</field></block></value></block></value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <statement name="DO0">
                      <block type="variables_set" id="evCountSet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar13">ai contracts</field>
                        <value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="evCountAdd"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evCountGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar13">ai contracts</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evCountOne"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value>
                        <next>
                          <block type="controls_if" id="evModeBranch">
                            <mutation elseif="2"></mutation>
                            <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="evModeCheck"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evModeGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evModeZero"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value>
                            <statement name="DO0"><block type="purchase" id="evBuyPrimary"><field name="PURCHASE_LIST">DIGITEVEN</field></block></statement>
                            <value name="IF1"><block type="logic_compare" id="evMarkovEvenCheck"><field name="OP">GTE</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evMarkovEvenGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar05">ai markov</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="evThreshGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar06">ai markov threshold</field></block></value></block></value>
                            <statement name="DO1"><block type="purchase" id="evBuyRecoveryEven"><field name="PURCHASE_LIST">DIGITEVEN</field></block></statement>
                            <value name="IF2"><block type="logic_compare" id="evMarkovOddCheck"><field name="OP">LTE</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evMarkovOddGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar05">ai markov</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="evOddBar"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="evOddHundred"><field name="NUM">100</field></shadow></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="evOddThreshGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar06">ai markov threshold</field></block></value></block></value></block></value>
                            <statement name="DO2"><block type="purchase" id="evBuyRecoveryOdd"><field name="PURCHASE_LIST">DIGITODD</field></block></statement>
                          </block>
                        </next>
                      </block>
                    </statement>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="after_purchase" id="evAfter01" x="760" y="760">
    <statement name="AFTERPURCHASE_STACK">
      <block type="controls_if" id="evResultIf">
        <mutation else="1"></mutation>
        <value name="IF0"><block type="contract_check_result" id="evResultWin"><field name="CHECK_RESULT">win</field></block></value>
        <statement name="DO0">
          <block type="controls_if" id="evRecoveredIf">
            <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="evRecoveredCheck"><field name="OP">GTE</field><value name="A"><block type="total_profit" id="evRecoveredProfit"></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evRecoveredZero"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value>
            <statement name="DO0">
              <block type="controls_if" id="evRevertNotifyIf">
                <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="evRevertModeCheck"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evRevertModeGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evRevertModeOne"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value>
                <statement name="DO0"><block type="notify" id="evNotifyRevert"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">success</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="evRevertText"><field name="TEXT">Recovered — session back in profit. Reverting to the AI Even primary strategy and resetting the stake.</field></block></value></block></statement>
                <next>
                  <block type="variables_set" id="evModeRevert"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evModeRevertN"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value>
                    <next>
                      <block type="variables_set" id="evStakeReset"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="variables_get" id="evStakeResetGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar01">ai base stake</field></block></value>
                        <next>
                          <block type="variables_set" id="evLossReset"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evLossResetN"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block>
                        </next>
                      </block>
                    </next>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </statement>
          </block>
        </statement>
        <statement name="ELSE">
          <block type="controls_if" id="evSwitchNotifyIf">
            <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="evSwitchModeCheck"><field name="OP">EQ</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evSwitchModeGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evSwitchModeZero"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value>
            <statement name="DO0"><block type="notify" id="evNotifySwitch"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">warn</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="evSwitchText"><field name="TEXT">Loss — switching strategy: Markov + AI recovery is live until the session is back in profit.</field></block></value></block></statement>
            <next>
              <block type="variables_set" id="evModeSwitch"><field name="VAR" id="evVar04">ai mode</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evModeSwitchN"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value>
                <next>
                  <block type="variables_set" id="evLossCountSet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="evLossCountAdd"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evLossCountGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="evLossCountOne"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value>
                    <next>
                      <block type="controls_if" id="evLadderIf">
                        <mutation else="1"></mutation>
                        <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="evLadderCheck"><field name="OP">LTE</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evLadderGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="evLadderMaxGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar09">ai max steps</field></block></value></block></value>
                        <statement name="DO0">
                          <block type="variables_set" id="evStakeGrow"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="evStakeMul"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="evStakeMulGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="evMulGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar07">ai multiplier</field></block></value></block></value></block>
                        </statement>
                        <statement name="ELSE">
                          <block type="notify" id="evNotifyCap"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">warn</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="evCapText"><field name="TEXT">Recovery ladder reached its cap — stake reset to base. Still in Markov + AI recovery mode.</field></block></value>
                            <next>
                              <block type="variables_set" id="evStakeCapReset"><field name="VAR" id="evVar02">ai stake</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="variables_get" id="evStakeCapGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar01">ai base stake</field></block></value>
                                <next>
                                  <block type="variables_set" id="evLossCapReset"><field name="VAR" id="evVar08">ai loss count</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="evLossCapN"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block>
                                </next>
                              </block>
                            </next>
                          </block>
                        </statement>
                      </block>
                    </next>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </statement>
        <next>
          <block type="controls_if" id="evAgainIf">
            <mutation else="1"></mutation>
            <value name="IF0">
              <block type="logic_operation" id="evAgainAnd"><field name="OP">AND</field>
                <value name="A"><block type="r_loss_guard" id="evAgainLoss"><value name="LIMIT"><block type="variables_get" id="evAgainLossGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar10">ai loss limit</field></block></value></block></value>
                <value name="B"><block type="r_profit_guard" id="evAgainProfit"><value name="TARGET"><block type="variables_get" id="evAgainProfitGet"><field name="VAR" id="evVar11">ai profit target</field></block></value></block></value>
              </block>
            </value>
            <statement name="DO0"><block type="trade_again" id="evTradeAgain"></block></statement>
            <statement name="ELSE"><block type="notify" id="evNotifyLimit"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">error</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="evLimitText"><field name="TEXT">Session limit reached (loss limit or profit target) — the bot stops here. Adjust the limits in Run once at start and run it again if you want another session.</field></block></value></block></statement>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
</xml>
